WEBVTT

00:08:59.908 --> 00:09:01.598
to hold ourselves accountable.

00:09:02.786 --> 00:09:05.892
Kind of like when America
lands in World War II

00:09:05.916 --> 00:09:07.799
and comes face-to-face with Hitler,

00:09:07.823 --> 00:09:09.521
and she knocks him the hell out ...

00:09:09.545 --> 00:09:11.015
(Laughter)

00:09:11.039 --> 00:09:14.099
just like Captain America did in 1941,

00:09:14.123 --> 00:09:17.975
and who knew we'd need America Chavez
to punch Nazis in 2018.

00:09:17.999 --> 00:09:19.651
(Laughter)

00:09:19.675 --> 00:09:23.651
(Applause)

00:09:23.675 --> 00:09:24.955
(Laughter)

00:09:24.979 --> 00:09:29.462
And even that, that justified act
kind of wrecks her a little bit,

00:09:29.486 --> 00:09:32.716
so I made sure that she linked up
with her best friend,